Error [E0963]: destructuring with 2 names, but this fixed-size list has 3 elements
  --> tests/ui/fixed_list_destructure_len.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     [a, b] #= result
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: a fixed-size list `[T#N]` has a known length — the pattern must match exactly
 Fix: use 3 names in the pattern
